        <detaileddescription>
<para>Property: exception_index_table</para><para>Each value in the exception_index_table array must be a valid index into the constant_pool table. The constant_pool entry at that index must be the CONSTANT_Utf8_info structure representing the string &quot;Exceptions&quot; (see section 4.4.7 of the JVM specification). </para>        </detaileddescription>
