    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>JVM Exceptions attribute.</para><para>The Exceptions attribute is a variable-length attribute in the attributes table of a method_info struction (see section 4.6 of the JVM specification). The Exceptions attribute indicates which checked exceptions a method may throw. </para>    </detaileddescription>
